{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Dark forces rise from every corner of the kingdom.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orcs, skeletal legions, and shadow-dwelling dwarves are attacking your realm, aiming to destroy the magical strongholds that protect it. Armed with cursed fireballs and siege magic, they descend upon your lands with relentless fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield of Breaker is a single-player arcade action game set in a stylized fantasy world. You play as a guardian knight, wielding a magical shield to deflect enemy fireballs and turn their own attacks against them. Timing, precision, and quick thinking are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/049b499835db0d8916f704f85cff5058.poster.avif?t=1761749252\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/049b499835db0d8916f704f85cff5058.webm?t=1761749252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/049b499835db0d8916f704f85cff5058.mp4?t=1761749252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Core Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        \u2022        Defend your castle by reflecting incoming fireballs with your enchanted shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        \u2022        Eliminate enemies by redirecting their projectiles strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        \u2022        Survive increasingly difficult waves filled with new enemy types and patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/458f0541a007acb4b278cfbc9bb50bf3.poster.avif?t=1761749252\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/458f0541a007acb4b278cfbc9bb50bf3.webm?t=1761749252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/458f0541a007acb4b278cfbc9bb50bf3.mp4?t=1761749252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Progression &amp; Upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        \u2022        Choose your guardian\u2014each with unique traits and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        \u2022        Upgrade your shield with elemental enhancements and passive buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        \u2022        Collect gold from fallen enemies to unlock new skills and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        \u2022        Lift sieges to access new regions of your realm, each with different environments, enemies, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/8146a26b7d5f47bf7fc9720410c4413b.poster.avif?t=1761749252\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/8146a26b7d5f47bf7fc9720410c4413b.webm?t=1761749252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/extras/8146a26b7d5f47bf7fc9720410c4413b.mp4?t=1761749252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Explore and Defend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory opens the path to new lands: haunted cliffs, frozen fortresses, sunken outposts. As you advance, secrets and lost relics await those who seek beyond the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores or uncovering hidden lore, Shield of Breaker offers a balance of fast-paced arcade action and fantasy immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f The fate of your kingdom doesn\u2019t rest in swords\u2026 but in your shield.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081240?t=1761749252","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/545a821490ba7132021a5dccf8254b0c43f9bdb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761749252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/d0a42b99baebb44a705062a85fd7d04702234a41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761749252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081240/d0a42b99baebb44a705062a85fd7d04702234a41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761749252","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4113980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Dark forces rise from every corner of the kingdom.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orcs, skeletal legions, and shadow-dwelling dwarves are attacking your realm, aiming to destroy the magical strongholds that protect it. Armed with cursed fireballs and siege magic, they descend upon your lands with relentless fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield of Breaker is a single-player arcade action game set in a stylized fantasy world. You play 